CONTROL (proves it is the ERROR PATH, not deep-link back in general):
  Same cold deep-link with the injection DISARMED -> store loads healthy -> tap "Back"
  -> lands on HOME correctly ("Deliver To: Others / 35X2+X2 Dubai", Home/Basket/Profile tabs).
  So the dead-end is specific to the store-details FAILURE path, i.e. inside this ticket's
